Hi,

Before the real run we tried the engine on a short pilot inside the history: a test book that started with 10,000,000 in cash at the close of 2026-02-06, bought at the open of the next session and sold part of one position in the last two sessions, with the engine in its full mode (0.2% sales tax, T+2 settlement). Its fills, its positions and the status table at every close are in the database export (desk_database.sql: tables pilot_fills, pilot_positions, pilot_status, pilot_weights). sample_call.json is the call the engine made after the close of 2026-02-20, exactly as sent; sample_output.json is the answer the pilot program gave (format only).

The notices in that call were test messages and mean nothing. In the real run the program receives the day's messages only inside each call (the "notices" list); it cannot read e-mail.

